WEBVTT

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:35.830
During the battle to let the Megafauna
escape from the Capital Territory,

00:01:35.830 --> 00:01:37.920
I built up my self confidence.

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:41.000
However, having self confidence
didn't actually help at all.

00:01:41.420 --> 00:01:43.840
Because reality changes moment by moment,

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:46.220
I was doing the best I could just to keep up.

00:01:46.760 --> 00:01:49.800
Which way must I go to reach tomorrow?

00:02:00.110 --> 00:02:02.570
This ship will ascend to geocentric orbit.

00:02:02.570 --> 00:02:05.950
Do a thorough check for any air leaks!

00:02:06.950 --> 00:02:09.820
I'm telling you to consider the
machines that might have to sortie,

00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:12.330
and arrange them based on that!

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:15.830
When adhering the reinforcing
coating, you need to apply pressure.

00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:18.500
You want to make the thickness uniform.

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:22.800
G-Self, you too. If you put coating into
the dents and apply pressure,

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:25.880
it will assimilate into the same
material as the ship's hull.

00:02:25.880 --> 00:02:27.300
Keep at it.

00:02:27.590 --> 00:02:30.550
Well, yeah, it's faster to
have the G-Self do it, but...

00:02:31.510 --> 00:02:33.350
That's dangerous!

00:02:33.350 --> 00:02:35.060
Don't put too much power into it.

00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:36.390
You'll put a hole in it!

00:02:36.390 --> 00:02:41.190
You don't wield a tool the way
you wield a weapon, comrade!

00:02:41.190 --> 00:02:42.770
I know that.

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:44.570
- It's because you won't stop moving...
- No!

00:02:44.570 --> 00:02:46.240
that the ropes are getting too tight!

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:49.660
Nobell, you tell us if Raraiya escapes.

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:50.740
Tell you!

00:02:50.740 --> 00:02:53.870
We can't have her running out
to hug the G-Self right now.

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:56.250
Well yes I suppose that's true.

00:02:56.250 --> 00:03:00.040
They're heading towards Capital Tower with
the Salamandra spearheading, right?

00:03:00.040 --> 00:03:03.090
That's what Ameria's state
broadcaster was saying.

00:03:03.090 --> 00:03:05.630
We will go to stop the Salamandra.

00:03:06.050 --> 00:03:07.340
What did you just say?

00:03:07.340 --> 00:03:09.800
Can we leave command of the Salamandra

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:14.350
in the hands of a young man who believes
the Amerian Army belongs to him?

00:03:14.350 --> 00:03:18.980
Yes, President Nicchini's son does
have that side to him, but...

00:03:18.980 --> 00:03:25.150
Captain Cahill's operation to occupy
the Capital Tower has no purpose now.

00:03:25.150 --> 00:03:27.990
Because now the Capital
Army is protecting it.

00:03:27.990 --> 00:03:29.200
That's right!

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:31.570
No war in space!

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:35.410
Raraiya, biological functions decreasing.

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:40.170
With this navigation system,

00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:42.540
I can make it back to
New Yark in no time, huh?

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:48.840
If the president is going to launch
the space fleet without my say so,

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:51.430
it's an infringement on my
absolute command authority.

00:03:56.430 --> 00:03:59.850
If you mean the news from
Ameria's state broadcaster,

00:03:59.850 --> 00:04:02.440
then it's meant as a threat
to the Capital Army.

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:05.150
It has nothing to do with our tower.

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:08.570
Is Capital Tower really
going to be all right?

00:04:08.570 --> 00:04:11.360
Ameria would not violate the taboo.

00:04:11.740 --> 00:04:13.110
I'm certain of it.

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:22.250
What was that just now?

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:30.670
Messame, taking off!

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:32.630
Grivobal, nothing amiss.

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:34.090
Barara, everything's good!

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:35.680
Haugezzen, following you now.

00:04:36.390 --> 00:04:37.720
All right,

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:39.520
we'll descend in a single stroke.

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:42.310
It's time to show what the Mack Knife can do!

00:04:46.190 --> 00:04:48.530
What? There are two ships?

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:53.660
Are they serious?!

00:04:57.160 --> 00:04:58.740
Darn it, Salamandra!

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:02.460
They think anything that comes
from Capital Tower is an enemy!

00:05:08.460 --> 00:05:13.470
The Space Garanden is looking
good, unlike when it was at sea.

00:05:15.970 --> 00:05:17.220
Mask.

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:21.310
To think he would bring cutting edge
machines all the way from Capital Tower.

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:22.810
I'll have to reevaluate my opinion of him.

00:05:25.270 --> 00:05:26.940
Aren't they a bit smaller than you'd think?

00:05:26.940 --> 00:05:28.820
They say their performance is solid.

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:30.360
They're not exactly great looking
though, don't you think?

00:05:30.360 --> 00:05:31.990
That has no effect on their performance.

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:34.650
Captain Mask is back!

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:36.450
Looks scary...

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:39.450
With this Mack Knife,

00:05:39.450 --> 00:05:42.500
I am prepared to wash away the
shame of my repeated losses!

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:44.660
Mask!

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:47.630
- Recruits do a deck check.
- Yes, Sir!

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:48.080
Mask! Mask! Mask! Mask!

00:05:48.340 --> 00:05:53.460
<i>﻿Colonel Cumpa and Commander Jugan seem
unusually adept at arranging these things.</i>

00:05:53.470 --> 00:05:56.680
If we leave so much as one screw,
one piece of rubber packing,

00:05:56.680 --> 00:05:59.100
it could damage the Mobile Suits!

00:06:01.180 --> 00:06:03.220
You seem to have adjusted to your work here.

00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:04.730
Yes!

00:06:04.730 --> 00:06:08.270
Take care of sorting the containers
that we brought with the Mack Knife.

00:06:08.270 --> 00:06:10.150
- Yes, sir!
- ﻿Barara!

00:06:10.150 --> 00:06:12.280
There are two enemy ships at the moment.

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:14.110
We'll assemble in the briefing room!

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:22.450
<i>﻿Luin...</i>

00:06:22.450 --> 00:06:25.160
<i>﻿I thought you were doing this
in the name of Kuntala pride...</i>

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:38.470
What were you doing during
the machine gun drill!?

00:06:38.470 --> 00:06:41.010
You failed to take down even a single glider?

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:43.260
As your commander,
I'm embarrassed for you!

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:51.060
Now then, let me introduce to you
to Mick Jack of the 2nd Team.

00:06:55.690 --> 00:06:57.400
Thank you, gentlemen!

00:06:57.400 --> 00:06:59.610
Once we occupy Capital Tower,

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:02.910
both the world and Capital
Tower will belong to Ameria!

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:06.540
When that time comes, Mick Jack
will be queen of the world!

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:08.160
And who will be its king?

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:09.750
You, Great Commander!

00:07:09.750 --> 00:07:12.040
President! We all respect you!

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:13.670
Not me!

00:07:13.670 --> 00:07:15.630
It will be someone among you who
distinguishes himself here!

00:07:20.510 --> 00:07:23.390
Quite a difference from when you
were on the pirate ship, huh?

00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:26.560
Pilots are simple. The trick to
using them is flattery.

00:07:39.110 --> 00:07:42.530
This Amerian Space Fleet
which we have constructed,

00:07:42.530 --> 00:07:47.660
in addition to settling our long running
intercontinental war with Gondwan,

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:52.080
is part of a strategy for Ameria to
dominate both the Earth and space.

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:54.290
Therefore, all fleets
under Rattle-Python—

00:08:00.220 --> 00:08:01.300
President!

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:09.680
This is the launching ceremony
for the space fleet!

00:08:09.690 --> 00:08:12.650
- What?
- Where did he come from?

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:15.480
- It's Inspector General Gusion!
- It's the Inspector General!

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:16.480
- ﻿Is he hurt?
- ﻿He's fine!

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:17.780
Gusion?!

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:19.360
You're late!

00:08:19.360 --> 00:08:21.570
- But what's going on?
- ﻿How the heck should I know?

00:08:21.570 --> 00:08:24.320
Where have you been all this time?

00:08:24.870 --> 00:08:29.080
I went to confirm the facts that our
highly capable spy agency has discovered.

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:31.500
You were investigating the facts?

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:34.630
Yes, it is true that Capital
Tower has raised an army. But...

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:41.630
Using Capital Tower as our foothold
to crush Gondwan was <i>your</i> plan!

00:08:41.630 --> 00:08:43.590
Yes, that is true. But...

00:08:43.590 --> 00:08:46.930
Why would you launch the Salamandra now?

00:08:46.930 --> 00:08:48.890
And without my clearance!

00:08:48.890 --> 00:08:52.480
You told me the Capital Army
had occupied the tower.

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:55.900
What's wrong with me launching the
fleet by my presidential authority?

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:57.980
I'd like you to cancel the attack for now!

00:08:57.980 --> 00:09:02.610
I ordered the space fleet to
provide logistical support!

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:05.110
It's too late for me to rescind it now!

00:09:05.740 --> 00:09:07.530
If it's too late for you to rescind the order...

00:09:07.990 --> 00:09:10.750
I am obligated to abide by military commands.

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:13.250
For the dignity of the Empire of Ameria,

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:15.500
bring an end to Capital Tower's monopoly,

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:17.250
and liberate the world!

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:18.380
Yes, sir!

00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:29.390
The Salamandra and Gavial are being
chased by our Garanden and the Pirate Ship.

00:09:30.390 --> 00:09:31.970
Warn all Mobile Suits,

00:09:31.980 --> 00:09:33.680
that if they move away
from Capital Tower now,

00:09:33.690 --> 00:09:35.650
they will be unable to return there.

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:36.810
Yes, sir!

00:09:36.810 --> 00:09:39.400
Oh. When did you arrive?

00:09:39.980 --> 00:09:43.900
I accompanied His Holiness.

00:09:43.900 --> 00:09:46.360
This place may turn into a battlefield.

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:50.490
It is my duty to watch over the Mask Corps.

00:09:50.490 --> 00:09:55.120
They'll sink those two hastily assembled
Amerian warships in no time,

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:58.500
and put President Zucchini in his place.

00:10:07.090 --> 00:10:10.850
<i>﻿If the Megafauna has also
gone up into space...</i>

00:10:10.850 --> 00:10:11.970
<i>﻿Bellri has too?</i>

00:10:12.430 --> 00:10:14.060
No, it couldn't be...

00:10:14.060 --> 00:10:15.560
Oh, Your Holiness.

00:10:16.020 --> 00:10:18.350
Oh, don't trouble yourself.

00:10:22.360 --> 00:10:27.200
The Megafauna which Bellri and Miss Aida
were aboard has come up into space...

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:30.620
The G-Self came down from space...

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:34.330
It can't be! I raised Bell!

00:10:34.330 --> 00:10:36.750
I won't hand him over to others!

00:10:44.090 --> 00:10:46.380
I see, according to Inspector General Gusion,

00:10:46.380 --> 00:10:50.930
we can take the SU-Cordist pope
captive in Sankt Porto as well.

00:10:50.930 --> 00:10:52.260
That's what he said, right?

00:10:52.260 --> 00:10:54.350
Yes, that seems to be the case.

00:10:54.350 --> 00:10:57.060
So he wasn't late just to be fashionable.

00:10:57.060 --> 00:10:58.980
Yes, exactly.

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:00.980
Here they come.

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:10.990
This fleet can protect my boy Klim
as he commands the Salamandra.

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:22.000
For them, a freshly established force
like the Capital Army is nothing.

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:43.020
We'll take a geocentric course
to ascend to satellite orbit.

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.060
From there, our course will be...

00:11:45.060 --> 00:11:48.060
To Sankt Porto at the steepest angle possible.

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:49.020
That's absurd!

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:52.730
It's to divide the Capital Army's forces.

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:55.070
Taking the pope hostage there...

00:11:55.070 --> 00:11:56.780
...﻿is also an option.

00:11:57.110 --> 00:12:00.870
If we do, this will be a rather
one sided turn of events.

00:12:00.870 --> 00:12:02.660
I suppose it will.

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:14.170
Miss Aida.

00:12:14.550 --> 00:12:15.510
What is it?

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:19.300
Y﻿ou can't reach the Salamandra on your own.

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:21.470
I have experience as a space pirate.

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:23.100
Raraiya got away!

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:25.060
Raraiya!

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:27.850
- No!
- ﻿How did you get loose?

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:29.310
- ﻿Oh, my.
- ﻿Huh?

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:38.900
Defense of this ship, the Space Garanden,

00:12:38.910 --> 00:12:40.780
will be done with Wuxia and Catsiths.

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:42.780
Wuxia, launch!

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:44.700
Don't get in the Mack Knife's way!

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:53.500
Commander Jugan is requesting
a two front operation.

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:56.800
This is our first battle in
space, for pity's sake!

00:12:56.800 --> 00:12:58.170
We're heading out!

00:13:02.430 --> 00:13:05.010
Right, Barara Peor, heading out!

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:15.360
Though Mobile Suits have
come out of the Garanden,

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:18.400
if I launch a preemptive attack
against the Capital Tower,

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:20.860
it will make them divide their forces.

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:22.860
I guess we have no choice.

00:13:22.870 --> 00:13:24.780
I'll handle intercepting them.

00:13:25.370 --> 00:13:26.580
Please, do.

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:34.960
Well then, I'll position the
Hecate behind the Salamandra,

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:38.170
and take on the guys who
came from the Garanden!

00:13:45.140 --> 00:13:46.510
The Salamandra is...

00:13:46.850 --> 00:13:49.640
Tch, Minovsky Particles.

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:54.020
Which means we're within
combat range of the enemy.

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:55.520
What?

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:59.230
The team of Mobile Suits that came
from the Garanden is acting strangely.

00:14:02.240 --> 00:14:04.910
Capital Army scum! You may be fast...

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:06.830
But so am I!

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:12.160
Suits are coming from
Capital Tower as well...

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:13.710
The Garanden is coming from over there!

00:14:13.710 --> 00:14:15.920
Miss Aida, you can't go out.

00:14:15.920 --> 00:14:18.210
My lady, your job is to guard the Megafauna.

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:19.300
Even you, Luan?

00:14:19.300 --> 00:14:22.760
If it's the Capital Army guys you're
worried about, I'll stop them.

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:25.430
I can't hear you. I can't hear you!

00:14:25.430 --> 00:14:26.390
What?

00:14:26.390 --> 00:14:28.850
Space Backpack, roger!

00:14:28.850 --> 00:14:30.390
Thanks!

00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:32.270
It's going to turn into a melee.

00:14:32.270 --> 00:14:35.270
Snipe anyone who comes out of it from here.

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:37.110
Oh, I see!

00:14:37.110 --> 00:14:38.650
I guess that makes sense.

00:14:40.820 --> 00:14:44.400
You must not hit Capital
Tower or any of our allies.

00:14:45.740 --> 00:14:47.160
Why aren't you shooting?

00:14:47.160 --> 00:14:50.580
Because our enemies and allies are all
mixed together between us and the nut!

00:14:53.460 --> 00:14:56.000
If you spread Minovsky Particles...

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:59.840
...it means I take you out
in close quarters combat!

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:06.340
You're even using your
wings to escape in space?

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:12.180
For my first space battle,
I shall float like a butterfly,

00:15:14.020 --> 00:15:16.310
and sting like a bee!

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:18.150
That's our genius, Klim!

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:20.730
Mick.

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:22.570
What of the unit that launched
from the Garanden?

00:15:22.990 --> 00:15:25.150
They came out in response to our launch.

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:26.320
They're chasing after us!

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:27.910
Where are they?

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:29.660
Th﻿ose Capital Army guys!

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:36.250
Notify the unit from Capital
Tower that we are allies.

00:15:42.050 --> 00:15:45.510
There's a Mobile Suit coming from
the direction of the pirate ship?

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:47.630
Is this it?

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:49.890
Hey, that's a Capital Guard Recksnow!

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:52.220
What is the meaning of this?

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:56.690
You will be my shield!

00:15:56.690 --> 00:15:57.810
What?

00:15:57.810 --> 00:16:00.360
You launched from the pirate ship!

00:16:00.360 --> 00:16:03.070
And where is <i>your</i> unit from?

00:16:03.070 --> 00:16:05.400
You Capital Guard amateur!

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:08.740
What's with this guy?

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:15.120
Even the pirate ship ought to
be able to read light signals.

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:18.920
Light signals?

00:16:20.920 --> 00:16:25.010
What did the Capital Army Mobile Suit say?

00:16:25.010 --> 00:16:28.720
"﻿If you turn over the G-Self
and Raraiya, we won't attack."

00:16:28.720 --> 00:16:30.260
That's what they said.

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:32.970
Huh? The G and Raraiya?

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:37.350
<i>﻿What will you do, Bell?</i>

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:39.690
<i>﻿Fight? Or stop?</i>

00:16:43.020 --> 00:16:44.360
It held!

00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:48.860
Even its fingers have beam cannons?

00:16:51.280 --> 00:16:54.410
Hey, G-Self! Surrender yourself to us.

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:55.580
Say what?

00:16:55.950 --> 00:17:00.540
If you do so, I will return
Lieutenant Kerbes and his Recksnow.

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:02.880
Who am I speaking with?

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:06.380
He came out.

00:17:18.770 --> 00:17:20.060
A wire?

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:21.650
If that had been a live round,

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:24.020
you would be dead.

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:25.860
Your surrender is a sure thing now.

00:17:26.280 --> 00:17:27.860
If you hand over Raraiya Monday as well,

00:17:27.860 --> 00:17:29.610
we will let the rest of you go.

00:17:30.240 --> 00:17:31.990
There's a mask under your helmet!

00:17:31.990 --> 00:17:34.950
Yeah, it's got data files
and sensors in it!

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:37.540
Raraiya still hasn't recovered her memories!

00:17:37.540 --> 00:17:38.910
We know that!

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:43.790
I'm gonna kick that Mask
guy right out of here!

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:49.010
Oh, no!

00:17:50.470 --> 00:17:52.180
Luan? Oliver?

00:17:53.930 --> 00:17:57.560
No matter where I go, the
grade skipper gets in my way!

00:17:57.560 --> 00:18:00.770
Barara, shake up the Megafauna and— Tch!

00:18:03.440 --> 00:18:05.310
Not with Raraiya on the ship...

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:11.110
Mask, you klutz! The G-Self made it back!

00:18:12.740 --> 00:18:14.990
Until Raraiya is in our hands,

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:16.740
we can't attack the Megafauna!

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:18.740
Ugh!

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:24.290
This Space Backpack is responsive.

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:27.540
A backpack and the Megafauna?

00:18:27.550 --> 00:18:29.340
There's no way for me to attack!

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:34.630
I can't let Miss Aida fight in the space war!

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:35.890
Go down!

00:18:38.060 --> 00:18:39.180
The beams are weak!

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:40.520
Why won't you go down?

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:48.610
- What?
- You stopped moving!

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:53.820
Either I'm a klutz, or the
enemy is way too good!

00:18:54.700 --> 00:18:56.320
Barara, you can stand down!

00:18:56.700 --> 00:18:58.330
She was tricked by that flash of light!

00:19:01.750 --> 00:19:02.910
Mask!

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:04.960
Cut the power to the parts
that are shorting out!

00:19:04.960 --> 00:19:06.420
Lieutenant Kerbes!

00:19:06.420 --> 00:19:08.920
Is it true they demanded Raraiya?

00:19:08.920 --> 00:19:13.010
It's true. That's why the enemy
isn't attacking the Megafauna.

00:19:13.010 --> 00:19:14.670
Raraiya, me.

00:19:14.680 --> 00:19:18.260
Still, there's no telling when
we may get hit by a stray shot.

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:19.470
Be careful.

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:21.010
How exactly are we supposed to be careful?

00:19:21.020 --> 00:19:23.140
What do we do? What do we do?

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:31.730
Your transformation...

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:33.070
will leave you wide open!

00:19:39.330 --> 00:19:40.410
Barara!

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:47.420
Captain Mask, were you facing the G-Self?

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:49.290
It was nothing serious.

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:52.300
But we failed to invade the Megafauna.

00:19:53.800 --> 00:19:56.300
Give the Mobile Suits the signal to return.

00:19:56.300 --> 00:19:58.890
To head to Capital Tower from here,

00:19:58.890 --> 00:20:01.810
we would need to return to
geocentric orbit, so that's not possible.

00:20:01.810 --> 00:20:05.310
Thanks to the Megafauna's bizarre behavior...

00:20:05.310 --> 00:20:10.520
﻿The Garanden's Mobile Suit corps
had a skirmish with the Megafauna,

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:12.150
but it seems they were unable to sink it.

00:20:12.150 --> 00:20:13.610
That's what it looked like.

00:20:13.610 --> 00:20:15.400
Why is that?

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:19.110
This was the Capital Army's first engagement
since ascending in their battleship.

00:20:19.660 --> 00:20:21.990
They'd be a bit disorganized,
wouldn't they?

00:20:24.250 --> 00:20:25.750
Well, that makes sense!

00:20:27.710 --> 00:20:29.370
That was pitiful.

00:20:29.380 --> 00:20:31.750
You came into contact with the Megafauna
and that was all you could do?

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:34.050
It was my own failure.

00:20:34.050 --> 00:20:37.010
I had forgotten the particularities
of low altitude flight.

00:20:37.470 --> 00:20:39.930
If that's a message from Colonel Cumpa,

00:20:39.930 --> 00:20:41.470
deliver it to Mask.

00:20:44.560 --> 00:20:48.180
The Captain's Mack Knife is so badly damaged.

00:20:56.320 --> 00:21:00.950
Mask's unit still lacks teamwork.

00:21:00.950 --> 00:21:05.290
It seems pushing immediately for a two
front operation came back to curse you.

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:07.040
It cursed me, huh?

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:12.920
I gave the order for the Garanden to
continue their ascent to Sankt Porto.

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:16.420
In order to protect the pope
from the threat in space, yeah?

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:18.880
But of course.

00:21:19.550 --> 00:21:22.180
Aida was able to return
to the Megafauna, right?

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:24.390
Yes. The G-Self returned as well.

00:21:24.390 --> 00:21:27.560
We have taken no losses or damage.

00:21:27.560 --> 00:21:30.940
This fleet will continue
ascending to Sankt Porto.

00:21:30.940 --> 00:21:32.520
- Understood?
- ﻿Yes, sir.

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:34.650
The supply ships are scheduled
to come up as well.

00:21:35.020 --> 00:21:36.820
Under this ship, the Rattle-Python,

00:21:36.820 --> 00:21:38.530
there are four Crocodile-class ships.

00:21:38.530 --> 00:21:40.990
They are faster than a Capital Tower Crown.

00:21:40.990 --> 00:21:46.280
The power of the Rose of Hermes
Blueprints is a thing to be feared.

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:57.300
﻿Inspector General Gusion is going up to
Sankt Porto in command of the Amerian fleet.

00:21:57.550 --> 00:21:59.340
Sankt Porto?

00:21:59.340 --> 00:22:02.380
That's the nut at the very
top of Capital Tower, right?

00:22:02.380 --> 00:22:05.470
It's the holy place where they
receive photon batteries.

00:22:05.470 --> 00:22:07.220
If a military force goes up there,

00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:10.100
it would be the worst possible violation
of the taboo. You'll be cursed!

00:22:10.850 --> 00:22:11.850
Cursed?

00:22:12.980 --> 00:22:14.190
We're talking about curses now?

00:22:14.190 --> 00:22:16.400
Well, of course you'd get cursed!

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:17.690
It's space.

00:22:17.690 --> 00:22:20.070
She said space! Space!

00:24:01.170 --> 00:24:04.920
Mr. Happa does his best to
strengthen the G-Self's armaments,

00:24:04.920 --> 00:24:07.090
and Miss Aida encourages me,

00:24:07.090 --> 00:24:09.380
so l decided to try using it.

00:24:09.430 --> 00:24:13.180
As a result, I was tied up when
I ascended to Sankt Porto,

00:24:13.180 --> 00:24:15.310
and what I saw at the Grand Cathedral was

00:24:15.310 --> 00:24:17.430
my mother, the pope, and...

00:24:18.140 --> 00:24:20.730
On the next Reconguista in G,

00:24:20.730 --> 00:24:23.190
Capital Tower Occupied.

00:24:23.190 --> 00:24:25.320
Enemies you can't see are terrifying!
